| **Cloud Run service** | Filter by service name; check the service table below for request count and latency. |
| **Pub/Sub topic / subscription, Cloud SQL database, Load balancer** | Use the counts and breakdowns below to identify the resource, then pivot to **Discover** with the relevant `gcp.labels.resource.*` field for full detail. |

